#X text 1900 640 run <1 or 0>: rush's loop has the sound \, and has the wet in it \, so the player stops with the recorder still frozen once e_rush has muted the kit \, 16 ms on \, and goes on where it was when the kit comes back. ref/module/sequencer.md, f 40;
